  "body": "Positioned in a peaceful bush-clad setting, this beautifully refurbished four-bedroom home offers spectacular sea views and a lifestyle that showcases the very best of the Hibiscus Coast. Combining modern comfort, flexible family living and a stunning natural environment, this is a property that will appeal to a wide range of buyers.\r\n\r\nWake to birdsong, enjoy your morning coffee while taking in the expansive outlook, and unwind each evening as the ever-changing sea views are painted by the setting sun. Surrounded by native bush and abundant birdlife, this home delivers a sense of privacy and tranquillity while remaining just minutes from local amenities.\r\n\r\nFully renovated throughout, there is nothing to do but move in and enjoy. With four generous bedrooms, three bathrooms, a large family-sized kitchen and multiple living areas, there is space for growing families, entertaining guests and creating dedicated work-from-home zones.\r\n\r\nFeatures You'll Love\r\n\r\n- Spectacular panoramic sea views\r\n- Four generous bedrooms\r\n- Three well-appointed bathrooms\r\n- Large modern kitchen, perfect for family living and entertaining\r\n- Fully refurbished and move-in ready\r\n- Peaceful setting surrounded by native bush\r\n- Abundant native birdlife\r\n- Fully fenced section, ideal for children and pets\r\n- Multiple living areas providing flexibility for families\r\n- Excellent work-from-home options\r\n- Close to schools, shops and local amenities\r\n- Minutes from beautiful beaches, boat ramps and coastal walkways\r\n\r\nWith Penlink set to significantly improve connectivity to and from the Hibiscus Coast, demand for quality homes in this sought-after location continues to grow. This is an outstanding opportunity to secure a property that offers lifestyle, flexibility and future appeal.\r\n\r\nHomes with panoramic sea views, complete modern refurbishment and the peace and privacy of a bush setting are exceptionally hard to find. Buyers looking for something special will immediately recognise the value on offer here.\r\n\r\nThe owners are highly motivated and clear instructions have been given to sell. Interest is expected to be strong, and properties of this calibre in Stanmore Bay are rarely available for long.\r\n\r\nAct quickly. Opportunities like this are limited, and once it's going, going, it's gone.\r\n\r\nAuction: 4:00pm, Thursday 26 November 2026 In Rooms, Ray White Orewa (unless sold prior). You can watch the auction live here: https://rwcarpenterrealty.co.nz/watch-our-auctions-live",
